/* DATA DESCRIPTION:
Citation:	Parga Martínez, Karla B; Andersen, Thorbjørn Joest; Posth, Nicole; da Silva, Vitor; Strand, Jakob (2024): Microplastics size class and fractions in a glacimarine sediment core from Disko Bay, Greenland [dataset]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.972712
Abstract:	The dataset contains information on microplastics particle size and size fractions throughout a sediment core from Disko Bay, Greenland, collected in August 2015 and dated back to 1930. Each sediment layer (depth) corresponds to a Lead-210 year categorized as Pre-plastic Boom (before 1950) and Post-Plastic Boom (after 1950). The polymer type, major and minor dimensions and the score were obtained during µ-FTIR data processing through the software sIMple. Particle size were categorized as small (20 - 100 µm) and large (>100µm) and further divided intro size fractions ((1) 20-50µm, (2) 50-100µm, (3) 100-250µm, (4) 250-500µm, (5) ≥500µm). This datasets is complementary to https://doi.pangaea.de/10.1594/PANGAEA.972635, https://doi.pangaea.de/10.1594/PANGAEA.972713, and the limits of detection are in https://doi.pangaea.de/10.1594/PANGAEA.972709.
Keyword(s):	Anthropocene; Arctic; Greenland; Marine sediment; Microplastics
Related to:	Parga Martínez, Karla B; Andersen, Thorbjørn Joest; da Silva, Vitor; Strand, Jakob; Posth, Nicole R (2024): Microplastics deposition in Arctic sediments of Greenland increases significantly after 1950. Communications Earth & Environment, 5(1), 584, https://doi.org/10.1038/s43247-024-01768-y
	Parga Martínez, Karla B; Andersen, Thorbjørn Joest; Posth, Nicole; da Silva, Vitor; Strand, Jakob (2024): Limit of detection (LoD) of microplastic accumulation in a glacimarine sediment core from Disko Bay, Greenland [dataset]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.972709
	Parga Martínez, Karla B; Andersen, Thorbjørn Joest; Posth, Nicole; da Silva, Vitor; Strand, Jakob (2024): Microplastics accumulation in a glacimarine sediment core from Disko Bay, Greenland [dataset]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.972635
	Parga Martínez, Karla B; Andersen, Thorbjørn Joest; Posth, Nicole; da Silva, Vitor; Strand, Jakob (2024): Microplastics particle morphology in a glacimarine sediment core from Disko Bay, Greenland [dataset]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.972713
Funding:	H2020 Marie Skłodowska-Curie Actions (MSCA), grant/award no. 801199: RECORD: An anthropogenic archive of plastic pollution in Greenland
